        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add more `Sec-CH` Client Hint headers]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28636</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28636"/>
        <updated>2025-12-12T01:05:48.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Adds the following Client Heights as supported by Chrome:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">Sec-CH-Device-Memory</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">Sec-CH-DPR</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">Sec-CH-Viewport-Height</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">Sec-CH-Viewport-Width</code></li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>

<p dir="auto">Visiting <a href="https://browserleaks.com/client-hints" rel="nofollow">https://browserleaks.com/client-hints</a> with Chrome shows the following:</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/525346659-9d7a3245-8e4c-48a7-9c7d-7f2db64d608e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..RO1S5niC-jKA8e067mBjHgAe30BKIaj9OXyGft6BkHQ"><img width="437" height="241" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/525346659-9d7a3245-8e4c-48a7-9c7d-7f2db64d608e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..RO1S5niC-jKA8e067mBjHgAe30BKIaj9OXyGft6BkHQ" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 241px;"></a>
<p dir="auto">Note that <code class="notranslate">Sec-CH-Device-Memory</code> is currently still specced as <code class="notranslate">Device-Memory</code> but I've <a href="https://github.com/w3c/device-memory/pull/51" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/device-memory/pull/51/hovercard">opened a PR to change that</a></p>

<p dir="auto">Device-Memory, DPR and Width were added in Chrome 97: <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/6658223894429696" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6658223894429696</a> (note Device-Memory was not noted there)</p>
<p dir="auto">Height was added in Chrome 105: <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5646861215989760" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5646861215989760</a></p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

<p dir="auto">MDN Content PR: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3719174104" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42351" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42351/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42351">mdn/content#42351</a></p>
]]></content>
