        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28570</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28570"/>
        <updated>2025-12-10T12:05:51.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/939727?u=2e25f47c213a7e8f2e4e57ddd4ee59ba6601eae3&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds the new <code class="notranslate">referencetarget</code> attribute to <code class="notranslate">&lt;template&gt;</code> and property to the ShadowRoot API.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Supporting details</h4>
