<li>document.browsingTopics()</li>
<li>browsingtopics attribute on HTML &lt;iframe&gt;</li>
<li>browsingTopics option in fetch()</li>
<li>Sec-Browsing-Topics HTTP request header</li>
<li>Observe-Browsing-Topics HTTP response header</li>
<li>HTTP header Permissions-Policy directive browsing-topics</li>
</ul>
